{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n ひらがな写真館に私の写真も載っています！！\n \n ぜひぜひ見てみてください！！\n \n \n \n 初めてこんなに薄着で写真を撮りました！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8SFP0VE5D5PN6MWZ73GFP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8SGNH91X232D12Y0DNENH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 少し緊張しました(//∇//)\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8SHKW1WF4GASRHW60AJ25","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8SJMF76MBW6TVWHH2CR8D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n オフショット。\n \n \n \n 色んな写真を撮ってもらいました！\n \n \n いっぱい撮ってもらえて楽しかったです！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8SKMBJCFEHNTAC1XH4P85","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n おやすみなさい。"}],"source":"archive"}